sequenceDiagram
    participant Viewer
    participant CF as Cloudflare Access
    participant Web as cctv-web
    participant API as cctv-api
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant LK as LiveKit Cloud

    Viewer->>CF: Request dashboard
    CF->>Viewer: IdP challenge if unauthenticated
    Viewer->>CF: Complete login
    CF->>Web: Forward request with signed identity headers/JWT
    Web->>API: Request session and camera list
    API->>API: Verify Access JWT and trusted headers
    API->>DB: Resolve user, roles, and ACLs
    API->>LK: Create viewer-only token
    API-->>Web: Session, cameras, LiveKit token
    Web-->>Viewer: Dashboard ready
